OL,3,GNEWSAMan in critical condition after
OL,4,Aattack near nightclub
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man remains in hospital in a
OL,7,Flife-threatening condition more than a
OL,8,Fweek after he was assaulted outside a
OL,9,Fnightclub.
OL,11,FThe victim, who is in his 30s, was
OL,12,Fattacked outside Antix on Park Street
OL,13,Fin Bristol at about 04:45 GMT on 14
OL,14,FNovember, police said.
OL,16,FOfficers arrested a man in his 40s in
OL,17,Frelation to the incident. He has since
OL,18,Fbeen released on conditional bail.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
