OL,3,GNEWSAMan in critical condition after
OL,4,Aattack near nightclub
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice say the victim left the venue
OL,7,Fjust before the incident, adding: "We
OL,8,Funderstand there were a number of
OL,9,Fpeople at the scene who may have
OL,10,Finformation which could assist us."
